where \(\tilde{X}_{o_{1}o_{2}o_{3}a_{4},mn}(\mathbf{R}_{m})\) are are the Fourier transformed channels

\[\tilde{X}_{o_{1}o_{2}o_{3}a_{4},mn}(\mathbf{R}_{m})=S_{\mathrm{BZ}}^{-1}\int d \mathbf{q}\tilde{X}_{o_{1}o_{2}o_{3}a_{4},mn}(\mathbf{q})e^{-i\mathbf{q}\mathbf{ R}_{m}}\] (S12)

